      "text": "\ud83c\udfc1 Honest Decision States:\n\u2022 \u2705 ACCEPTED (Strong & Uncontradicted)\n\u2022 \u26a0\ufe0f UNCERTAIN (Low margin / Ambiguous)\n\u2022 \ud83d\udeab REJECTED (Temporal contradiction)\n\u2022 \u2753 NO_MATCH (Under min threshold)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "baseline": 12,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "\ud83c\udfc1 Honest Decision States:\n\u2022 \u2705 ACCEPTED (Strong & Uncontradicted)\n\u2022 \u26a0\ufe0f UNCERTAIN (Low margin / Ambiguous)\n\u2022 \ud83d\udeab REJECTED (Temporal contradiction)\n\u2022 \u2753 NO_MATCH (Under min threshold)",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
