      "text": "\ud83d\udcca Output, Presentation & Data Contracts\n\u2022 Realtime Video Playback: Synchronized side-by-side player with detection bounding boxes & track trajectories\n\u2022 Aligned Tracklet Gallery: High-resolution visual crops, track durations, mean detector confidence & direction\n\u2022 Instant CSV Export: Full audit logs (motorcycle_detection_status.csv & motorcycle_tracks_summary.csv)",
